#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "40408"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF is right.\nLet's head back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "40944"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF is right there.\nLet's #C000246204press on#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "41964"
msgid "We obtained the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nLet's go back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "42256"
msgid "Apocalypse Now!\nCome back soooooooon!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "42724"
msgid "Surely you aren't thinking of WALKING back?\nDo you intend to make me march for no purpose?\nLook for that #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "43636"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF is right.\nLet's head back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1659
msgctxt "47864"
msgid "　Obtained\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."
msgstr "　Obtido:\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "47908"
msgid "Obtained"
msgstr "Obtido"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584828"
msgid "I guess to #C236196003Jinako#CDEF, this is her \"comfy space\"…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584904"
msgid "Don't. …like I just told you,\nyou can't get this #C000246204SG#CDEF unless someone dies.\nNo sort of brute force is gonna fly."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "585532"
msgid "Stay here."
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "585820"
msgid "Why is he suddenly so desperate?\nI'm a bit concerned."
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "586060"
msgid "UAAAAAHHHHHH!! JINAKOOOO!!! WHERE ARE YOU!!!?"
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "586108"
msgid "GOD DAMN! WRONG PATH!!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586352"
msgid "Huh…? What is… this?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586684"
msgid "You hear me?\nOnce that number hits zero, you're a goner.\nNo resets allowed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586772"
msgid "Got it?\nI warned you.\nAnything happens, it's your own dang fault."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587660"
msgid "Count… down?\nIs this a curse?\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF is challenging me, isn't she?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587840"
msgid "…well, that aside,\nplease go about your business as usual, Darling."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588220"
msgid "…but to be honest, it wasn't really that big a shock to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588432"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF said,\n\"We'll end up in the same place.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588600"
msgid "…let's look for #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589520"
msgid "…………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590044"
msgid "A menacing #C236196003#SVT#CDEF draws closer to the\ntotally defenseless #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590464"
msgid "You said someone must die,\nbut then what happens to #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF's\ncountdown?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590644"
msgid "Hm…? Well, duh."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591376"
msgid "…old man…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591824"
msgid "After all the trouble he's been in after warning him,\nhe's going to try and tackle the Labyrinth alone, AGAIN?\nAnd without a Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592612"
msgid "A sore task!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592632"
msgid "…however, see how that grown man supplicates\nus without shame. Let's turn back, Praetor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "593404"
msgid "Woah. That's our famously stubborn,\nhotdogger-and-microwave-everything granny for\nyou! Yes, your concerns are understandable."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "593904"
msgid "Wrong way.\nHome's this-a-way."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "594848"
msgid "Apocalypse Now!\nCome back soooooooon!"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "594940"
msgid "Not yet."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "594952"
msgid "I'm ready."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595104"
msgid "―――Wha?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595508"
msgid "Out with that \"genius plan\" you promised!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595800"
msgid "Wha―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595816"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595824"
msgid "……\nSo, a lie?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596204"
msgid "To do that, I mustn't be occupied with\nsuch trivial Labyrinth traps and enemies."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596408"
msgid "Come! To the pessimist #C000246204Sentinel#CDEF! We haven't\nthe leisure to stroll, for the counter above\nour heads continues to fall!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596860"
msgid "Old man…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596876"
msgid "We drag ourselves back to where #C236196003Jinako#CDEF is.\nShe even stuck around for us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597368"
msgid "Hahaha.\nThe Earth had no such place where I belonged,\nnot anywhere."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597868"
msgid "Gross, you sideburns creep.\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF isn't a Christian or a Buddhist."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598100"
msgid "Precisely now that your creed is desperate,\nconsider praying to my resplendent god.\nWhen one door is shut, another window opens!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598568"
msgid "………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598584"
msgid "…………(Praetor.)"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598608"
msgid "……(Master?)"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598632"
msgid "……(Darling.)"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598656"
msgid "……(well, mongrel?)"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599160"
msgid "―――But no genius can break THIS wall."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599332"
msgid "As a human being, not moving a\nsingle step is to be expected."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599396"
msgid "Hmmm. I have to admit, it IS true."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599704"
msgid "It's pointless to chase after me.\nOnly death lies ahead. No killing.\nJust simple death."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599980"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600012"
msgid "Gah, poofing away AGAIN!?\nHold it, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF!\nOoooaaahhhhh!!!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600100"
msgid "Wai… #C236196003Monji Gatou#CDEF!\nDon't go alone!\nYou WILL perish!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600228"
msgid "Oh…?\nYou see that guy?\nHe just ran off on his own."
msgstr ""

